sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant Handler as "api::portfolio::allocations"
    participant Alloc as "AllocationsService"
    participant Portfolio as "PortfolioRepo<br/>(SqliteRepo)"
    participant Providers as "CryptoProvider / EquityProvider<br/>(CoinMarketCap, brapi, Finnhub)"
    participant Barca as "BarcaTargetRepo<br/>(SqliteRepo)"
    participant Compute as "compute_allocations<br/>(pure function)"
    participant Snap as "SnapshotRepo<br/>(SqliteRepo)"

    Note over Client,Handler: CurrentUser extractor verifies the access_token<br/>cookie first — see docs/sequence-login.mmd.

    Client->>Handler: GET /api/allocations
    Handler->>Alloc: refresh_prices()

    Alloc->>Portfolio: fetch_positions()
    Portfolio-->>Alloc: Vec<WalletPosition>

    Alloc->>Providers: crypto.fetch_latest()
    Providers-->>Alloc: Vec<MarketQuote> (failure → 502)
    Alloc->>Providers: br/us fetch_quotes(symbols)
    Providers-->>Alloc: Vec<MarketQuote> (failure → logged, assets skipped)

    Alloc->>Barca: fetch_barca_targets(current_market)
    Barca-->>Alloc: Vec<BarcaTarget>

    Alloc->>Compute: compute_allocations(positions, quotes, targets)
    Compute-->>Alloc: AllocationReport (typed, sorted)

    Alloc->>Snap: record_snapshot(report)
    Note over Snap: ONE transaction: allocations payload +<br/>history_assets/groups/barca/totals
    Snap-->>Alloc: ok

    Alloc-->>Handler: AllocationReport
    Handler-->>Client: 200 OK (JSON)

    Note over Client,Snap: Every log line carries the request span<br/>(method, uri) from tower-http's TraceLayer.
